    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Excellent three bedroom family home in a prime residential setting nestled in the popular Willowbank development on the outskirts of Mallow Town. This beautifully presented three bedroom semi-detached residence offers spacious and well-appointed accommodation throughout. This property is ideally suited to first-time buyers, families, and investors alike."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and comprises an inviting entrance hall, spacious livingroom, fully fitted kitchen, diningroom with French doors to the rear garden and guest WC at ground floor level. Upstairs features three generous bedrooms including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a family bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance hall -  20' 3\"  x  7' 3\" \r\nTimber flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen -  12' 6\"  x  13' 9\" \r\nFully fitted kitchen/Tiled flooring\r\n\r\nDiningroom -  14' 4\"  x  10' 3\" \r\nTimber flooring/French doors opening to rear garden/Double doors leading to living room.\n\r\n\r\nLivingroom -  20' 7\"  x  15' 9\" \r\nCarpet flooring/Feature fireplace with gas insert/Bay window providing excellent natural light.\n\r\n\r\nGuest wc - \r\n\r\n\r\nStairs & landing - \r\nCarpeted stairs/Timber flooring on landing.\n\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 -  20' 3\"  x  13' 6\" \r\nTimber flooring/Built-in wardrobes\nEnsuite                                                    9'4\" x 6'5\"\nTimber flooring\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 -  15' 6\"  x  12' 6\" \r\nTimber flooring/Spacious double bedroom\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 -  10' 3\"  x  9' 9\" \r\nIdeal bedroom, nursery or home office\r\n\r\nBathroom -  11' 6\"  x  9' 3\" \r\nFully tiled/Bath with electric shower overhead\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tPVC double glazed windows and doors throughout\r\n•\tGas fired central heating.\r\n•\tFully alarmed\r\n•\tStira to partially floored attic\r\n•\tHot press\r\n•\tFront and rear gardens\r\n•\tSide gate access\r\n•\tOutside tap\r\n•\tPrivate parking/concrete driveway\r\n•\tOverlooking a large green area\r\n•\tMains water and mains sewerage\r\n•\tBenefiting from easy access to the N20 Cork/Limerick Road,\r\n•\tLocated in a sought-after residential estate on the outskirts of Mallow Town"
      },
